stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CardPresented

    CardPresented --> AuthorizationRequested : Customer enters card details
    AuthorizationRequested --> IssuingBankCheck : Payment gateway sends auth request

    IssuingBankCheck --> AuthorizationApproved : Sufficient funds & valid card
    IssuingBankCheck --> AuthorizationDeclined : Insufficient funds / fraud / invalid card

    AuthorizationDeclined --> [*]

    AuthorizationApproved --> AuthHoldPlaced : Temporary hold on customer funds
    AuthHoldPlaced --> TransactionCompleted : Merchant completes sale

    TransactionCompleted --> BatchSubmitted : End-of-day batch submission
    BatchSubmitted --> ClearingProcess : Card network clears transactions

    ClearingProcess --> SettlementProcess : Issuing bank transfers funds
    SettlementProcess --> MerchantAccountCredited : Acquiring bank credits merchant

    MerchantAccountCredited --> [*]
